      "created_at": "2026-08-22T15:38:09+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-22T15:41:42+00:00",
      "touched_round": 3,
      "title": "Web UI API calls return 401 (no API key sent)",
      "summary": "All /api/v1/* routes are behind apimw.APIKeyAuth. The server resolves an API key (auto-generated dev key or configured api.key) via resolveAPIKey/config.Load. The web UI is served as static files (http.FileServer(http.Dir(\"web\"))) and web/index.html + web/js/app.js call /api/v1/* without any X-API-Key header -> every web API call returns 401. The entire browser UI is non-functional against the authenticated API."
    },
